<!-- AA 分账（校园小工具）
     视觉：工具主题 · 成员 → 账单 → 方案 三段式，全部本地计算，无网络请求
     装饰签名（见 docs/dev/MP-VISUAL-SYSTEM.md）：rise + dot-b -->
<view
  class="qz-page th-toolkit split"
  bindtouchstart="onFxStart"
  bindtouchmove="onFxMove"
  bindtouchend="onFxEnd"
  bindtouchcancel="onFxEnd"
>
  <!-- 装饰层（不拦截点击；只有装饰层跟随指针，内容区不跟随） -->
  <view class="qz-deco">
    <view class="qz-fx" style="{{fxStyle}}">
      <view class="rise-particle qz-rise"></view>
      <view class="qz-dot qz-dot-b"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="qz-content">
    <view class="head qz-an-in qz-d1">
      <text class="title">AA 分账</text>
      <text class="sub">本地计算，不联网、不上传账单</text>
    </view>

    <!-- ---------- 成员 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card qz-an-in qz-d2">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>成员</text>
        <text class="card-title-hint">改名字后所有账单同步更新</text>
      </view>

      <view class="member-row" wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id">
        <input
          class="member-input"
          value="{{item.name}}"
          placeholder="成员 {{index + 1}}"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          bindinput="onMemberInput"
        />
        <view class="del qz-press" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRemoveMember">×</view>
      </view>

      <view class="actions">
        <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onAddMember">+ 添加成员</view>
        <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onReset">清空重来</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- ---------- 账单 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card qz-an-in qz-d3">
      <view class="card-title">
        <text>账单</text>
        <text class="card-title-hint">金额单位是元，最多两位小数</text>
      </view>

      <view class="bill qz-card-tint" wx:for="{{expenses}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="bill-head">
          <picker
            class="bill-payer"
            mode="selector"
            range="{{memberLabels}}"
            value="{{item.payerIndex}}"
            data-id="{{item.id}}"
            bindchange="onPayerChange"
          >
            <view class="payer-box">
              <text class="payer-label">付款人</text>
              <text class="payer-name">{{memberLabels[item.payerIndex]}}</text>
              <text class="payer-arrow">›</text>
            </view>
          </picker>
          <view class="del qz-press" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onRemoveExpense">×</view>
        </view>

        <view class="bill-amount">
          <text class="yuan">¥</text>
          <input
            class="amount-input"
            type="digit"
            value="{{item.amount}}"
            placeholder="0.00"
            data-id="{{item.id}}"
            bindinput="onAmountInput"
          />
        </view>

        <view class="bill-participants">
          <view class="chips">
            <view
              class="chip qz-press {{p.picked ? 'chip-on' : ''}}"
              wx:for="{{item.participants}}"
              wx:for-item="p"
              wx:key="id"
              data-id="{{item.id}}"
              data-mid="{{p.id}}"
              bindtap="onToggleParticipant"
            >
              {{p.label}}
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="chip-all qz-press" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onToggleAllParticipants">
            全选 / 全不选
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="actions">
        <view class="btn btn-ghost qz-press" bindtap="onAddExpense">+ 添加一笔</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- ---------- 结果 ---------- -->
    <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in" wx:if="{{computed && result && result.error}}">
      <text class="err-title">这笔账还算不出来</text>
      <text class="hint">{{result.error}}。请补全后再看方案。</text>
    </view>

    <block wx:elif="{{computed && result && result.totalCents > 0}}">
      <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in">
        <view class="card-title">
          <text>结算方案</text>
          <text class="card-title-hint">合计 ¥{{totalText}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="settle" wx:for="{{settleRows}}" wx:key="key">
          <text class="settle-from">{{item.fromName}}</text>
          <text class="settle-arrow">→</text>
          <text class="settle-to">{{item.toName}}</text>
          <text class="settle-amount">¥{{item.amountText}}</text>
        </view>

        <view class="settle-none" wx:if="{{settleRows.length === 0}}">
          <text>大家已经两清，谁都不用转账 🎉</text>
        </view>

        <view class="btn btn-solid qz-press" wx:if="{{settleRows.length}}" bindtap="onCopyPlan">
          复制方案
        </view>
        <text class="hint">
          按"最大债务人 → 最大债权人"逐笔冲抵，笔数不会超过「人数 − 1」；
          不保证是理论最少笔数，但金额一定对得上。
        </text>
      </view>

      <view class="qz-card result qz-an-in">
        <view class="card-title">
          <text>每人净额</text>
          <text class="card-title-hint">垫付 − 应摊</text>
        </view>
        <view class="balance-row" wx:for="{{balanceRows}}" wx:key="id">
          <text class="balance-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="balance-state state-{{item.state}}">{{item.stateText}}</text>
          <text class="balance-amount {{item.state === 'even' ? 'amount-even' : ''}}">
            ¥{{item.amountText}}
          </text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="qz-card empty qz-an-in" wx:elif="{{computed}}">
      <text class="empty-title">填上谁付了多少，方案自动出来</text>
      <text class="hint">
        纯本地计算，不用点提交按钮；金额只在「元」和「分」之间做整数换算，不会出现差一分钱的情况。
      </text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
